  "translation": "Today is Saturday. I and a friend left home together to go to the park. There are many trees and flowers in the park. We first rested under a tree for a while. Then we didn't go anywhere else, we went to the lakeside to watch fish. The fish in the lake are many, I don't know what flower this is. We sat in front of a big tree. My friend can swim, but I cannot swim well. He swims very fast. We bought two ice creams. The ice cream is very delicious. We played very happily. At 5:30 in the afternoon we returned home. Today is really a wonderful day."
